mplateOperation()`.\n- L316-343 `handleApply` calls the apply mutation; on `getApplyTemplateResultOutcome(result) === 'applied'` calls `resetOperation()` + `onApplied?.()`.\n- L432-471 shows `samples` (`Add sample content`) and `blockedSamples` (`Deferred content`).\n- L537-549 Apply button.\n\n### Jotai atoms / state\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/client-config/states/onboardingConfigState.ts` (L4-7) — `onboardingConfigState` (`installAppsCreditsRewardPerApp`).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/states/onboardingFreeCreditsState.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/states/onboardingNavigationDirectionState.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/states/isWelcomeAnimationVisibleState.ts`, `shouldOpenAiChatAfterOnboardingState.ts`\n\n### GraphQL (frontend)\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/graphql/queries/workspaceTemplatePreview.ts` — `WorkspaceTemplatePreview($template: WorkspaceTemplate!)`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/graphql/mutations/applyWorkspaceTemplateOperation.ts` — `applyWorkspaceTemplateOperation(input: ApplyWorkspaceTemplateOperationInput!)`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/graphql/mutations/applyWorkspaceTemplate.ts` — legacy `applyWorkspaceTemplate(input: ApplyWorkspaceTemplateInput!)`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/graphql/mutations/triggerInstallAppsOnboardingStep.ts`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/graphql/mutations/skipSyncEmailOnboardingStep.ts` (preceding step), `goBackToPreviousOnboardingStep.ts`, `completeBookCallOnboardingStep.ts`\n\n### What determines the steps\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/hooks/useSetNextOnboardingStatus.ts`\n  - L35-86 `getNextOnboardingStatus` encodes the order: `WORKSPACE_ACTIVATION → SYNC_EMAIL → APPS_INSTALLATION → PROFILE_CREATION → INVITE_TEAM → [BOOK_CALL] → PLAN_REQUIRED/COMPLETED`.\n  - L129-140 triggers welcome animation + AI chat when transitioning **to** `COMPLETED`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/hooks/useTriggerInstallAppsOnboardingStep.ts` (L13-32) mutation then `setNextOnboardingStatus(...)`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/utils/getInstallAppsStepHistoryEffect.ts` (L3-15).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/hooks/useInstallOnboardingApps.ts` (L8-57): `toggleApp`, `installSelectedAppsAndContinue` (`triggerStep(selected)`), `skip` = `triggerStep([])`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/effect-components/InstallAppsAutoSkipEffect.tsx` (L17-35) calls the mutation with `[]` + `isAutoSkipped: true`.\n\n### Where \"completes onboarding\" is triggered\nThere is no single \"complete\" mutation. Completion is the **absence of all pending flags**:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/hooks/useSetNextOnboardingStatus.ts` L85 `return OnboardingStatus.COMPLETED;` (client).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/core-modules/onboarding/onboarding.service.ts` L191 `return OnboardingStatus.COMPLETED;` (server `getOnboardingStatus`).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/onboarding/utils/getHasJustCompletedOnboarding.ts` L13-15 detects the transition.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Frontend constants/types enumerating personas/templates\n\n| Identifier | File | Lines |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ONBOARDING_INSTALLABLE_APPS` | `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/mo